        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;READING THE BOUNDARIES&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Blue: authenticated request dependencies; green dashed: background Graph/read/write; purple: telemetry; gray: network association.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Private endpoints are NICs, not the PaaS service. Outbound VNet integration does not create private inbound ingress.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Optional components are dashed amber. Token-only limits are not dollar-spend guarantees; private-network acceptance is separate.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#687787;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
