        <mxCell id="revocation" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;REVOCATION / RECLASSIFICATION • bounded, not instantaneous&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;⑦ Group removal → successful sync → resolver / cache refresh → subsequent requests denied&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Baseline allow TTL 120s; refusal 30s; extra last-known-good grace 3600s on resolver failure&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Urgent: verify registry revoke, then deploy policy keyVersion • no eager generation eviction&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Move A → B: remove A / prove deny / add B; dual classifications never silently upgrade&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;New spend stamps B; historical spend remains with A, never rewritten from today&amp;#x27;s directory&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf5ea;strokeColor=#107c10;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="1905" width="1730" height="195" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;READING THIS OVERVIEW&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;BLUE solid arrows ①–④: synchronous auth / request dependency; response returns on the same request path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;GREEN dashed arrows ⑤ / ⑦: asynchronous membership projection / revocation   •   PURPLE dotted ⑥: telemetry / reporting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;ORANGE dashed: administrator control plane or optional credential / monetary path   •   GRAY dotted, no arrow: network association&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Solid blue/green service boxes: integrated implementation baseline (not live acceptance); amber dashed: optional production wiring / monetary or cross-tenant path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Boundaries: dashed labeled tenant / subscription / VNet / subnet containers; cloud-managed PaaS runs OUTSIDE VNet&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Source baseline: ADR-0026 / ADR-0028; manual + quickstart modules, gateway policy, CLIENTS / SYNC / CHARGEBACK (see ARCHITECTURE.md)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#687787;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="2140" width="2390" height="220" />
        </mxCell>
